{"unit_id":"huguangyu666__dsh-plugin-backdrop#card-zh","repo":"huguangyu666/dsh-plugin-backdrop","commit":"964db33419ad48c760feaf7ad674f101b0e0f85c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-backdrop 是面向 DSH Web UI 的动态背景插件。它通过 Web 客户端注入固定于页面底层的背景容器，并将页面表面设为透明以透出动画。背景由 WebGL2 流体、循环游动并带故障转场的字符鲸鱼、可选发光鱼群和点线网格组成。用户可分别启用图层、调整透明度与效果参数，也可切换鲸鱼渲染引擎。适合希望为 DSH 网页界面添加动态视觉效果的用户；流体层需要 WebGL2，插件配置保存在浏览器本地。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client-source.js:361-390","src/engine/fluid-background.js:34-64","src/engine/whale-canvas.js:101-115","src/engine/fish-canvas.js:115-139","src/engine/grid-background.js:17-35"]}
{"unit_id":"huguangyu666__dsh-plugin-backdrop#card-en","repo":"huguangyu666/dsh-plugin-backdrop","commit":"964db33419ad48c760feaf7ad674f101b0e0f85c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-backdrop adds animated backgrounds to the DSH web UI: WebGL2 fluid effects, a swimming ASCII whale with glitch transitions, optional glowing fish, and a dotted grid. Users can toggle layers and adjust settings. The fluid layer requires WebGL2; settings stay in browser storage.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client-source.js:361-390","src/engine/fluid-background.js:34-64","src/engine/whale-canvas.js:101-115","src/engine/fish-canvas.js:115-139","src/engine/grid-background.js:17-35"]}
